/*
 * Implements semantic validation for logical binary operators.
 *
 * This module validates logical operations such as:
 *
 *   - boolean logical operators(&&, ||),
 *   - class-specific logical operator overloads,
 *   - enum logical operations(via enum unwrapping),
 *
 * and integrates with the general binary-operator validation pipeline.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::binary::logical
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/binary/logical.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-27
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
